atlas opportunity

architecture blocker-graph
  canonical_name BlockerGraph
  family opportunity
  domain Opportunity / Institutional Capacity
  layer opportunity
  semantic_question What is currently preventing this opportunity from being reachable?
  purpose Missing identity verification, evidence, authority, budget, service, qualification, relationship, field; external wait; human approval.
  maturity architectural
  node_types Blocker
  edge_types blocks
  forbidden_inference blocker removed -> opportunity won
  source_lineage SEED-A recursive organ document
  known_gap not implemented

architecture unlock-graph
  canonical_name UnlockGraph
  family opportunity
  domain Opportunity / Institutional Capacity
  layer opportunity
  semantic_question What reachable action would unlock institutional capacity that is currently out of reach?
  purpose Models reachable institutional capacity: relationship -> reviewer access, grant -> equipment, training -> human capability, evidence -> eligibility, service activation -> executable capacity. May be conditional and non-monotonic.
  maturity architectural
  node_types Unlock
  edge_types unlocks
  invariant unlock may be conditional and non-monotonic
  forbidden_inference an unlock exists -> the unlock is authorized or free
  source_lineage SEED-A recursive organ document
  known_gap not implemented; the highest-value opportunity architecture to build next

architecture resource-activation
  canonical_name ResourceActivationGraph
  family opportunity
  domain Opportunity / Resource
  layer opportunity
  semantic_question How does a currently-unavailable resource become reachable and usable?
  purpose World-expansion: capability gap -> candidate -> qualification -> eligibility -> authority -> activation mechanism (service lease, GPU, human commitment, voucher, credential). Only after activation does ProviderGraph see a usable resource.
  maturity architectural
  node_types CapabilityGap
  node_types ResourceCandidate
  node_types ActivationMechanism
  edge_types qualifies
  edge_types activates
  forbidden_inference provider available -> resource activation bypassed
  source_lineage SEED-A recursive organ document
  known_gap not implemented; ServiceLifecycleGraph is one activation mechanism already real
